/**
 * Neon background templates.
 *
 * The category held eight entries, and most of them were a plain two-stop
 * gradient wearing the word neon -- Vapor Glow is pink-to-yellow with no
 * dark ground and nothing that reads as emitted light. These are built the
 * way neon actually reads: a near-black ground, and light that falls off
 * from a source. Three forms across fifteen hues --
 *
 *   Grid   a lit grid with the glow pooled along the bottom edge
 *   Tubes  lit horizontal tubes, bright core with falloff either side
 *   Halo   a sign's glow seen through scanlines
 *
 * Rows are keyed on slug via updateOrCreate, so re-running this is safe and
 * an admin's later edit to a template is overwritten only by re-seeding.
 */
class NeonBgTemplatesSeeder extends Seeder
